Subject: Pack native Vulkan texture tables into one descriptor set

Port only descriptor packing and SPIR-V remapping from Buku313's
rexglue-skate3-android 19050db. Keep the existing descriptor-cache lifetime,
pool allocation, pipeline construction, and null-pipeline guard unchanged.

Turnip on the Retroid Pocket Mini V2 allows four bound descriptor sets.
The old scene layout used seven; the first FMV V-plane sample used set 4
and faulted the GPU at address zero. Keep buffers/samplers in set 0 and
pack all texture tables into set 1 with the upstream stride-8 mapping.

Source: https://github.com/Buku313/rexglue-skate3-android/commit/19050db

